This repository contains a Moodle plugin (mod_bento) made up of parts
under different licenses:

  - The PHP files (everything needed to run as a Moodle plugin —
    lib.php, view.php, manage.php, classes/, db/, etc.) are licensed
    under the GNU GPL v3 or later, per each file's own @license
    doc-block header. This follows Moodle's own licensing
    requirements for plugins that use Moodle's core APIs. Full text:
    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html

  - The plugin's own original client-side JavaScript — bentoconvert.js,
    bentopaste.js, and addsubmissiontile.js — is licensed separately,
    under the terms in LICENSE-JS.md (non-commercial use freely
    permitted; commercial use requires the author's express written
    permission).

  - Third-party libraries under thirdpartylibs/ (e.g. JSZip) remain
    under their own respective licenses, unaffected by either of the
    above.

